<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 5, 2004 :: BoT Tower Bosses</div><P>Decided to head on up and kill those Mini Bosses in BoT! Grats Balut on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Wand_of_the_Ice_Storm.gif">Wand of the Ice Storm</A>, Druentia on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/wanderers_sylvan_tunic.jpg">Wanderer's Sylvan Tunic</A>, Bukowski on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/cap_drowned_souls.jpg">Cap of Drowned Souls</A>, Thayet and Neola on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/stormriders_signet.jpg">Stormrider's Signets</A>, Arglar won the greed roll for an ornate chain breastplate mold and Druentia, Punkgurl and Parnicail all got a Rune! </P>
<P>Um... some folks leveled in the past couple days I haven't been on... pretty sure that's true.. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 2, 2004 :: Ring War for BOB!!</div><P>Grats BOB on your shiny new Ring of Dain Frostweaver... maybe Jakr will get to use it now and again too! And grats to Emmajo on the Crown of Narandi, Tankorr on the Choker of the Wretched and some other people on the other stuff! </P>
<P>Grats Emmajo on 63!<BR>Grats Ladibugg on 62!<BR>Grats Scheni on 60 and Phantasmist! <BR>Grats Lovem on 59!<BR>Grats Puven on 41!</P>
<P>(edit)</P>
<P>As part of me losin yet another blasted&nbsp;bet I am bein forced ta use me art work for evil and was told ta draws how I saw the fight ta get that cat his ring... here be the pic I hope ya be happy...</P>
<P><IMG alt=Bah! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/arglar/narandi.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Arglar on Mar 4, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Mar 1, 2004 :: Grats Zorin on your water sprinkler!</div><P>A rare, relatively low LD, Zorin appearance happened late last night so we grabbed a couple people and killed Ragefire for him! After not too many LDs, he finished his hand in and got his clicky stick! Grats Z! </P>
<P>Grats Punkgurl on 65 and Lady Protector!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 29, 2004 :: Battle with old what's his face... by Arglar</div><P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/arglar/al.jpg" align=baseline border=0> </P>
<P>Arch Lich is dead! I have crappy picture but Arglar promised&nbsp;a new picture soon, til then, this will have to do! <BR><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/al.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Lovem on your Lava Infused Bludgeon, Garetjax on your Platinum Mesh Guard and Lushissx on Ebony Armguards! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Arglar<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Mar 1, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 28, 2004 :: Big dead crystal dragon</div><P>I sure didnt' take a picture, but I'll go find one to steal somewhere to put here to show the big glass dragon in Valor. He was kind enough to donate a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Double_edged_Greatsword_of_Visions.jpeg">spiffy enormous sword</A> to Garacaius and Greylok got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/honorablelongsword.jpg">pretty new sword </A>herself! </P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/ad.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>There's been a few more liches in the guild... Grats Kaministef and Moordread on 65! <BR>Grats Punkgurl on 64!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 62!<BR>Grats Emmajo on 61!<BR>Grats Mabh on 60.. but you're still not as cool as Druentia the kiting machine at AD...<BR>Grats Turtleman on 51 and Vicar!</P>
<P>Holler if I missed any levels.. at Arglar.</P>
<P>Oh! And biggest ass ever goes to YOUNGONE from FU.. though I don't think they want him either.&nbsp; Here's to hoping the wizard can get you a brain, assclown. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Mar 1, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 25, 2004 :: Quack! </div><P>Omigosh I forgot to add this before, but grats to Chawnti on your epic duck completed! I'll add a picture as I remember to get one fixed up!</P>
<P>And because he's just way too excited and too cute about it.. welcome Lovem as a full member! And the lovely Evangelle as well! I know, I don't normally announce those, but he's very excited. </P>
<P>Did a ring war for Lairiel last night, fun as always. Grats Lair on your Ring of Dain Frostreaver, Perragon won the Crown of Narandi and Kasiryn won the Choker of the Wretched! The rest of the stuff went to greed rolls. </P>
<P>We also got another talisman, this time Cerdiwan won it, and Grellk got some head! Then a whole bunch of earrings upgraded some folks and rotted. </P>
<P>There's been levels and stuff. /nods</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 21, 2004 :: Very quiet rabbit hunting week..</div><P>Ah.. the week draws to a close and we've done relatively little. </P>
<P>Look soon to see (3) epic steps completed for folks, possibly a dragon kill, maybe even an LDoN/GoD raid complete.</P>
<P>Who knows.. we might .. /gasp see some levels if Wonderous actually writes them down.. I do know Duktak hit 56th!<BR><BR>Zorin got his Epic Note from the Overking!<BR>Papajay got his Epic Sword Piece from the Queen!<BR><BR>Must sleep.</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Feb 22, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 20, 2004 :: I need to hire someone else to update this!</div><P>Okies, been a bit since anyone has touched this. I blame Arglar, as usual. </P>
<P>Had a little war in Iceclad and Dorina got her shawl finally! Big Grats! Some people won some greed rolls on the other drops, though I have no idea who really. It's all about the shawl!</P>
<P>Yeli gave up his head to Divan, Bryte got a mask, Spark got a robe and Anarandil got his neck. </P>
<P>Had a bigger, more exciting war for Beryllin who ended it with his Ring of Dain Frostreaver! Grats super tracker! Sindall got a nice neck and Punkgirl finally won the crown... will wonders never cease?! Rest of the hero stuff and lance went to greed, and I don't keep track of that stuff. </P>
<P>Worked on some more keying folks for BoT and actually a couple PoJ runs here and there through the week. Thanks Frogger for running those!</P>
<P>Got fresh blood in Sleepers and went in and got more prismatic for folks and some more quest stuff. And Jakr got a pair of the elusive Fistwraps! </P>
<P>Week of the new expansion was a bit slower along with the server crashes.. all that crashing with zoning, etc. Some folks explored the new zones and got some neat stuff. </P>
<P>Some...but I'm sure not all.. leveling grats!</P>
<P>Grats Brytelyte on 65 and Coercer!<BR>Grats Grellk on 65 and um..&nbsp; big knight title!<BR>Grats Kami on 64!<BR>Grats Punk on 63!<BR>Grats Belice on 55 and Templar!<BR>Grats Arwiin on 50!<BR>Grats Turtle on 47!<BR>Grats Emmajo on 58!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=3'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a> <a href='news.asp?page=2'>2</a> <a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a> 4 <a href='news.asp?page=5'>5</a> <a href='news.asp?page=6'>6</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=5'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
